## 1. Purpose

This policy assigns approval limits by role. Amounts above a role’s limit go to the {{ facts.above_limits_authority }}.

## 2. Scope

Applies to origination and limit increases. Policy exceptions are not delegated here; see CP-EXC-2026-01.

## 3. Thresholds

- Relationship Manager unsecured approval is ≤ {{ facts.rm_unsecured_limit }}.
- Branch Credit Manager residential approval is ≤ {{ facts.branch_credit_manager_residential_limit }} and LTV ≤ {{ facts.branch_credit_manager_max_ltv }}.
- Regional Credit Officer SME approval is ≤ {{ facts.regional_credit_officer_sme_limit }}.
- Above these limits → {{ facts.above_limits_authority }}.

## 4. Authority

The {{ facts.above_limits_authority }} owns this matrix. Relationship Managers cannot approve policy exceptions (CP-EXC-2026-01).

## 5. Related policies

See Exceptions and Override (CP-EXC-2026-01), Unsecured Consumer (CP-UCL-2026-01), and SME Lending (CP-SME-2026-01).
